# --- Citation information (LAYERS.md "Relationship with derived projects") ---

cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "R 4.5.3 analysis environment"
message: "If you publish results obtained with this environment, please cite it using the information below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Imai"
    given-names: "Kei"
    email: "keiimai1220@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "The University of Tokyo, Japan"
abstract: >-
  A runtime environment template for reproducible analysis (Docker and renv).
  It provides only the recording layer, which keeps for each run the run_id, the SHA-256 of the files read, the git commit, a snapshot of the runtime environment, the resolved config, and a ledger of all runs. The analysis itself is written on top of this layer in each project, and no analysis code is bundled.
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-17"
keywords:
  - reproducible research
  - R
